To run Movian from source with the WebAssembly build:


   source emsdk/emsdk_env.sh
   ./configure.wasm
   make BUILD=wasm stage

Then serve the staged directory:

   cd build.wasm/stage
   python3 -m http.server 8000

Open http://localhost:8000/index.html in a browser.

Do not open `index.html` directly via `file://`.
The WebAssembly runtime fetches `movian.wasm` and other assets, which modern
browsers block from local file URLs.

The old `background.js` and `manifest.json` files are Chrome App / NaCl leftovers
and are not part of the normal WASM startup path anymore.

For more key bindings see
 https://movian.tv/projects/showtime/wiki/Key_mappings
